      "comment": "BELIEVE IN DREAM (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Did It Happen (16.62) in a Grade 6. Has the pace to be prominent. Rates highly and will give a great sight. PENNY PINCHER (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from five tries. Missed the frame latest (17.48) when fourth over 300m at Mandurah in a Grade 5. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. PINGELLY PRINCE (2) had to overcome a collision with another runner and could manage only a distant sixth (17.99) in a Grade 5 over 297m at Northam. Bold showing expected on best. BLOSSOMING FUN (6) has top-three aspirations after placing in good time last time.",
